  "description": {
    "raw": "The target becomes fixated on avoiding damage and fails to\nspot even the most opportune moments to attack. Whenever\na creature the target threatens would provoke an attack of\nopportunity from the target, the target must succeed at a Will\nsave or be unable to make the attack of opportunity against\nthat creature.",
